   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • ELECTRONICS ENGINEERING • +2 / -0.66",
   "html": "<p>Consider the I-V characteristics of the two ideal p+-n step junction diodes maintained at room temperature. The diodes are identical except their doping concentrations <em>N</em><sub><em>D</em>1</sub> and <em>N</em><sub><em>D</em>2</sub>, and their mobilities μ<sub><em>p</em>1</sub> = 4 μ<sub><em>p</em>2</sub> respectively.</p>\n\n<div> </div>\n\n<div><img alt=\"\" src=\"media/18/1820e50276882c57c898.png\" /></div>\n\n<div> </div>\n\n<div>Then which of the following options are correct?</div>",
   "options": [
