   "html": "<p>The hole concentration in a semiconductor varies linearly from <em>x</em> = 0 to <em>x</em> = 0.01 cm. The hole diffusion coefficient <em>D<sub>p</sub></em> = 10 cm<sup>2</sup>/sec, the hole diffusion current density is 20 A/cm<sup>2</sup>, and the hole concentration at <em>x</em> = 0 is <em>p</em> = 4 × 10<sup>17</sup> cm<sup>–3</sup>. The hole concentration at <em>x</em> = 0.01 cm is</p>",
